WEBVTT

00:02:10.200 --> 00:02:13.832
Below the reach of the Sun, the animals make their own light.

00:02:14.032 --> 00:02:17.738
A jellyfish flashes a ring of blue to startle a hunter.

00:02:17.938 --> 00:02:20.529
An anglerfish dangles a glowing lure.

00:02:20.729 --> 00:02:24.371
Lanternfish carry rows of tiny lights along their bellies.

00:02:24.571 --> 00:02:26.585
Most creatures down here glow.

00:02:26.785 --> 00:02:30.427
In the largest living space on Earth, light is a language.

